= Writing a theory section 
- context
  - introduction + theory to set the scene & grab attention (why does any of this matter at all)
- conflict
  - identity what the problem is (e.g. we dont know enough about ...)
- solution
  - your methodological approach + results/ key insights (present the reseach it self)
- conclusion
  - reinforce key message + implications